.TH dalgon-help-dev-journal 1  "dalgon-help-dev-journal " 
.SH NAME
dalgon\-help\-dev\-journal \- Replay, diff, and edit session journals.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgon help dev journal\fR [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replay, diff, and edit session journals.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalgon\-help\-dev\-journal\-replay(1)
Fold a journal and print the recovered state.
.TP
dalgon\-help\-dev\-journal\-diff(1)
Print the folded fields that differ between two journals.
.TP
dalgon\-help\-dev\-journal\-torn(1)
Copy a journal with its tail cut mid\-record.
.TP
dalgon\-help\-dev\-journal\-sidecar(1)
List or dump the sidecar files in a session directory.
